<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">KEUTUHAN DATA LAMA</div><h1>Data & Migrasi<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>Jejak pemulihan, arsip, dan rekonsiliasi database penggajian.</p></div><span class="soft-badge"><?=count($tables)?> tabel terarsip</span></div><div class="migration-grid"><section class="surface"><div class="migration-status"><span><?=icon($runs?'shield':'database')?></span><div><strong><?=$runs?'Riwayat migrasi tersedia':'Menunggu migrasi database lama'?></strong><p>Arsip sumber dipertahankan terpisah dari data operasional aplikasi.</p></div></div><div class="panel-body"><h2 class="mb-3">Riwayat pemulihan & impor</h2><?php if(!$runs):?><div class="empty-state compact"><?=icon('database')?><strong>Belum ada impor yang dijalankan</strong><p>Data ringkasan tidak diisi dengan angka contoh.</p></div><?php endif;?><?php foreach($runs as $run):$summary=json_decode($run['summary'],true);?><div class="mb-4"><span class="<?=$run['status']==='verified'?'badge-verified':'badge-pending'?>"><?=e($run['status']==='verified'?'Terverifikasi':$run['status'])?></span><p class="mt-3 mb-1"><strong><?=e($run['source_database'])?></strong> · <?=e($run['created_at'])?></p><p class="muted-small"><?=e($summary['tables']??0)?> tabel · <?=e($summary['rows']??0)?> baris arsip · <?=e($summary['operational_rows']??0)?> baris operasional</p><small class="muted-small d-block text-break">SHA-256: <?=e($run['source_sha256'])?></small><?php if(!empty($summary['issues'])):?><div class="alert alert-warning mt-3"><?php foreach($summary['issues'] as $issue):?><div><?=e($issue)?></div><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?></div><?php endforeach;?></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table app-table"><thead><tr><th>Tabel sumber</th><th class="text-end">Baris aktif sumber</th><th>Arsip</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($tables as $table):?><tr><td><strong class="code-text"><?=e($table['table_name'])?></strong></td><td class="text-end"><?=e($table['row_count'])?></td><td><a href="<?=url('arsip',['table'=>$table['table_name']])?>">Lihat arsip <?=icon('chevron')?></a></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$tables):?><tr><td colspan="3" class="table-empty">Inventaris tabel akan muncul setelah migrasi.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></section><aside class="surface"><div class="panel-header"><h2>Alur migrasi yang dapat diaudit</h2></div><div class="panel-body pt-0"><ol class="migration-steps"><li>Periksa backup dan pulihkan salinan melalui SQL Server.</li><li>Baca seluruh tabel aktif, struktur, indeks, dan definisi objek.</li><li>Arsipkan nilai sumber tanpa menghilangkan nol, NULL, atau spasi.</li><li>Petakan kolom berdasarkan nama dan impor ke MySQL.</li><li>Bandingkan setiap nilai serta total sebelum menyatakan migrasi selesai.</li></ol><div class="form-note"><?=icon('lock')?><span>Migrasi dijalankan melalui perintah lokal. Aplikasi tidak menerima unggahan EXE atau backup melalui browser.</span></div><p class="muted-small">Panduan lengkap tersedia pada README.md dan dokumen proyek di komputer pengelola.</p></div></aside></div>
